<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="29753663"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1162638033"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Shooting Star"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TeddyLoid / IA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="IA/03 -VISION-"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:56.293"><div begin="00:00.000" end="04:56.293"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.980" itunes:key="L1">Shooting Star - TeddyLoid (榊原テディ)</p><p begin="00:01.980" end="00:03.960" itunes:key="L2">詞：KURIS,YUICHI NAKASE<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi ： KURIS,YUICHI NAKASE</span></p><p begin="00:03.960" end="00:05.940" itunes:key="L3">曲：KURIS,YUICHI NAKASE<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kiyoku ： KURIS,YUICHI NAKASE</span></p><p begin="00:05.940" end="00:14.610" itunes:key="L4">Ah遠い宇宙にずっと続く道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直通往遥远宇宙的路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah too i so la ni zu to cuzu ku miqi</span></p><p begin="00:14.610" end="00:22.320" itunes:key="L5">まばたくように闇を照らす白い光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪烁照亮黑夜的白光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ba ta ku yo u ni yami wo te la su xilo i hikali</span></p><p begin="00:22.320" end="00:29.430" itunes:key="L6">行き先なら教えてあげるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会告诉你所去之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ki saki na la oxi e te a ge lu yo</span></p><p begin="00:29.430" end="00:35.240" itunes:key="L7">未来の鍵握りしめて旅立とう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握未来钥匙踏上旅程</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi lai no kagi nigi li xi me te tabi da to u</span></p><p begin="00:35.240" end="00:37.180" itunes:key="L8">Ah思いっきり泣いた夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声痛哭的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah omo i ki li na i ta yolu</span></p><p begin="00:37.180" end="00:39.120" itunes:key="L9">過去にgoodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告别过去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ko ni goodbye</span></p><p begin="00:39.120" end="00:41.260" itunes:key="L10">君たちがいたからさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因有你们陪伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi ta qi ga i ta ka la sa</span></p><p begin="00:41.260" end="00:42.850" itunes:key="L11">もう戻らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再回头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u modo la na i</span></p><p begin="00:42.850" end="00:45.810" itunes:key="L12">手と手をつないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">手牵着手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te to te wo cu na i de</span></p><p begin="00:45.810" end="00:49.220" itunes:key="L13">走れ走れ走れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔跑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">haxi re haxi re haxi re</span></p><p begin="00:49.220" end="00:50.360" itunes:key="L14">ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu to</span></p><p begin="00:50.360" end="00:54.190" itunes:key="L15">One love大きな賢で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一份爱 以伟大的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One love oo ki na ai de</span></p><p begin="00:54.190" end="00:57.800" itunes:key="L16">One heart心ひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一颗心 心系成一体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One heart kokolo hi to cu</span></p><p begin="00:57.800" end="01:02.530" itunes:key="L17">勇気出して月を目指して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鼓起勇气向着月亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yuu ki da xi te cuki wo me za xi te</span></p><p begin="01:02.530" end="01:05.230" itunes:key="L18">進み続けよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续前行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">susu mi cuzu ke yo u</span></p><p begin="01:05.230" end="01:08.930" itunes:key="L19">One lifeこの瞬間を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次人生 将这个瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One life ko no xiyun kan wo</span></p><p begin="01:08.930" end="01:12.510" itunes:key="L20">One chanceつかみ取ろうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次机会 紧紧握住吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One chance cu ka mi to lo u yo</span></p><p begin="01:12.510" end="01:17.420" itunes:key="L21">ひとつひとつの輝きを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去收集</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to cu hi to cu no kagaya ki wo</span></p><p begin="01:17.420" end="01:20.050" itunes:key="L22">かき集めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个个的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ki acu me yo u</span></p><p begin="01:20.050" end="01:23.630" itunes:key="L23">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 多远也可以去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="01:23.630" end="01:27.340" itunes:key="L24">どこまでも行けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">海角天涯都能抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo yu ke lu yo</span></p><p begin="01:27.340" end="01:31.070" itunes:key="L25">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 哪里也可以闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="01:31.070" end="01:36.270" itunes:key="L26">どこまでも輝くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永恒闪耀如初</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo kagaya ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:36.270" end="01:41.590" itunes:key="L27">そう気がついたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是啊 我察觉到了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ki ga cu i ta no</span></p><p begin="01:41.590" end="01:46.950" itunes:key="L28">私の悩みは星達より<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的烦恼比起星星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no naya mi wa hoxi taqi yo li</span></p><p begin="01:46.950" end="01:52.710" itunes:key="L29">ずっとずっとちいさいのにね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明要渺小的多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu to zu to qi i sa i no ni ne</span></p><p begin="01:52.710" end="01:59.660" itunes:key="L30">なぜこんなに苦しかったのだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可为何还是会这么的痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ze ko n na ni kulu xi ka ta no da lo u</span></p><p begin="01:59.660" end="02:03.290" itunes:key="L31">身をまかせて空を見上げ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交给身体仰望天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi wo ma ka se te sola wo mi a ge</span></p><p begin="02:03.290" end="02:05.760" itunes:key="L32">時を待とう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待时光吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">toki wo ma to u</span></p><p begin="02:05.760" end="02:07.690" itunes:key="L33">Ah思いっきり泣いた夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声痛哭的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah omo i ki li na i ta yolu</span></p><p begin="02:07.690" end="02:09.470" itunes:key="L34">振り返らず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我亦不会回头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu li kae la zu</span></p><p begin="02:09.470" end="02:11.570" itunes:key="L35">君たちがいたからさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因有你们陪伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi ta qi ga i ta ka la sa</span></p><p begin="02:11.570" end="02:12.950" itunes:key="L36">恐くないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kowa ku na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:12.950" end="02:16.230" itunes:key="L37">一歩踏み出して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出最初的一步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i po fu mi da xi te</span></p><p begin="02:16.230" end="02:19.730" itunes:key="L38">行こうみんな進め<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和大家一起前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ko u mi n na susu me</span></p><p begin="02:19.730" end="02:21.070" itunes:key="L39">きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki to</span></p><p begin="02:21.070" end="02:24.690" itunes:key="L40">One love燃える願いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一份爱 燃烧的心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One love mo e lu nega i wo</span></p><p begin="02:24.690" end="02:28.260" itunes:key="L41">One heart貫き通す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一颗心 贯彻到最后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One heart culanu ki too su</span></p><p begin="02:28.260" end="02:33.110" itunes:key="L42">迷わずに星屑の道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需迟疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mayo wa zu ni hoxi kuzu no miqi</span></p><p begin="02:33.110" end="02:35.690" itunes:key="L43">駆け抜けようよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">共同跑过星屑之路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke nu ke yo u yo</span></p><p begin="02:35.690" end="02:39.390" itunes:key="L44">One life大切なもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次人生 重要的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One life tai secu na mo no</span></p><p begin="02:39.390" end="02:43.010" itunes:key="L45">One chance逃さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次机会 都请别错过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One chance noga sa na i de</span></p><p begin="02:43.010" end="02:48.040" itunes:key="L46">ひとつひとつの輝きを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去收集</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to cu hi to cu no kagaya ki wo</span></p><p begin="02:48.040" end="02:50.450" itunes:key="L47">かき集めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个个的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ki acu me yo u</span></p><p begin="02:50.450" end="02:54.100" itunes:key="L48">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 多远也可以去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="02:54.100" end="02:57.320" itunes:key="L49">どこまでも行けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">海角天涯都能抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo yu ke lu yo</span></p><p begin="02:57.320" end="03:01.500" itunes:key="L50">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 哪里也可以闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="03:01.500" end="03:05.970" itunes:key="L51">どこまでも輝くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永恒闪耀如初</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo kagaya ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:05.970" end="03:12.930" itunes:key="L52">Let's dance<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们共同起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dance</span></p><p begin="03:12.930" end="03:21.630" itunes:key="L53">輝くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灿烂闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kagaya ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:21.630" end="03:23.670" itunes:key="L54">スピード上げて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加快速度</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su pi i do a ge te</span></p><p begin="03:23.670" end="03:27.360" itunes:key="L55">流れ星に飛び乗ってみよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一跃跳上流星吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">naga re boxi ni to bi no te mi yo u</span></p><p begin="03:27.360" end="03:28.850" itunes:key="L56">Oh oh oh<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh oh</span></p><p begin="03:28.850" end="03:38.680" itunes:key="L57">すべてを託して未来へ飛び出せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寄托所有飞往未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te wo taku xi te mi lai he to bi da se</span></p><p begin="03:38.680" end="03:42.310" itunes:key="L58">One love大きな愛で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一份爱 以伟大的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One love oo ki na ai de</span></p><p begin="03:42.310" end="03:45.910" itunes:key="L59">One heart心ひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一颗心 心系成一体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One heart kokolo hi to cu</span></p><p begin="03:45.910" end="03:50.490" itunes:key="L60">勇気出して前を向いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鼓起勇气向着前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yuu ki da xi te mae wo mu i te</span></p><p begin="03:50.490" end="03:53.340" itunes:key="L61">進み続けよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续前行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">susu mi cuzu ke yo u</span></p><p begin="03:53.340" end="03:56.880" itunes:key="L62">One lifeこの瞬間も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次人生 这个瞬间也</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One life ko no xiyun kan mo</span></p><p begin="03:56.880" end="04:00.630" itunes:key="L63">One chance夢に負けない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次机会 不会输给梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">One chance yume ni ma ke na i</span></p><p begin="04:00.630" end="04:05.470" itunes:key="L64">自分を信じてまっすぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心相信自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bun wo xin ji te ma su gu</span></p><p begin="04:05.470" end="04:08.140" itunes:key="L65">描くストーリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ega ku su to o li i</span></p><p begin="04:08.140" end="04:11.630" itunes:key="L66">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 多远也可以去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="04:11.630" end="04:15.370" itunes:key="L67">どこまでも行けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">海角天涯都能抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo yu ke lu yo</span></p><p begin="04:15.370" end="04:18.990" itunes:key="L68">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 哪里也可以闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="04:18.990" end="04:22.810" itunes:key="L69">どこまでも輝くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永恒闪耀如初</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo kagaya ku yo</span></p><p begin="04:22.810" end="04:26.640" itunes:key="L70">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 多远也可以去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="04:26.640" end="04:29.800" itunes:key="L71">どこまでも行けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">海角天涯都能抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo yu ke lu yo</span></p><p begin="04:29.800" end="04:33.910" itunes:key="L72">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh-Oh- 哪里也可以闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p><p begin="04:33.910" end="04:37.390" itunes:key="L73">どこまでも輝くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永恒闪耀如初</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo kagaya ku yo</span></p><p begin="04:37.390" end="04:56.293" itunes:key="L74">Oh oh<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh oh</span></p></div></body></tt>